# predicate/

Comprehensive test suite for the Riffle predicate system. Covers the core evaluation engine (Item, Predicate, Loop, Pipeline), type coercion, caching layer, resolution and registration, and standard library predicates. Includes end-to-end integration tests with DSL loading and CSV processing.

## Files

- `item_test.exs` -- Item: field storage, tag management, metadata operations
- `predicate_test.exs` -- Predicate evaluation: matching, tag collection, cache integration
- `coerce_test.exs` -- Type coercion: integer, float, text, number, boolean conversions
- `loop_test.exs` -- Loop composition and predicate filtering
- `pipeline_test.exs` -- Pipeline processing and CSV input handling
- `standard_lib_test.exs` -- Standard predicates: text, numeric, boolean, collection, date operations
- `resolver_test.exs` -- Predicate and loop resolution from modules and inline code
- `registry_test.exs` -- Module-based predicate registration and lookup
- `default_pipeline_config_test.exs` -- DefaultPipelineConfig implementation
- `default_pipeline_resolution_test.exs` -- Default pipeline fallback resolution
- `cache_test.exs` -- Cache: put, get, expiration, TTL, statistics
- `predicate_cache_integration_test.exs` -- Predicate evaluation with caching
- `loop_cache_integration_test.exs` -- Loop filtering with caching
- `user_test.exs` -- End-to-end: DSL loading, CSV processing, filtering workflows
